<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Wettergraph - F-Droid repo</title>
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
  body {
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  code, .url {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.9em;
    word-break: break-all;
  }
  .url {
    display: block;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid currentColor;
    border-radius: 6px;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }
  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.1rem;
    border: 1px solid currentColor;
    border-radius: 6px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .shots {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }
  .shots .widget { width: calc(50% - 0.4rem); }
  .shots .settings { width: min(100%, 22rem); }
  .shots img {
    width: 100%;
    border: 1px solid currentColor;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: #222;
  }
  @media (max-width: 40rem) {
    .shots .widget { width: 100%; }
  }
  footer { margin-top: 3rem; font-size: 0.85em; opacity: 0.7; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>Wettergraph</h1>
<p>F-Droid repository with signed release builds of
<a href="https://github.com/macmacs/Wettergraph">Wettergraph</a>, a fork of
AF Weather Widget.</p>

<h2>Add the repo</h2>
<p>With F-Droid installed, tap the button on your phone:</p>
<p><a class="btn" href="fdroidrepos://macmacs.github.io/Wettergraph/fdroid/repo?fingerprint=__FINGERPRINT__">Add to F-Droid</a></p>

<p>Or add this URL manually under <em>Settings &rarr; Repositories</em>:</p>
<span class="url">https://macmacs.github.io/Wettergraph/fdroid/repo</span>

<h2>Verify the fingerprint</h2>
<p>The repository signing key fingerprint (SHA-256) is:</p>
<span class="url">__FINGERPRINT__</span>

<h2>Screenshots</h2>
<div class="shots">
  <img class="widget" src="screenshots/wettergraph_cold.png" alt="Cold winter day" loading="lazy">
  <img class="widget" src="screenshots/wettergraph_warm.png" alt="Warm summer day" loading="lazy">
  <img class="widget" src="screenshots/wettergraph_color_black.png" alt="Black theme, rainy day" loading="lazy">
  <img class="widget" src="screenshots/wettergraph_round_corners.png" alt="Black theme with rounded corners" loading="lazy">
  <img class="settings" src="screenshots/wettergraph_settings.png" alt="Widget settings" loading="lazy">
</div>

<footer>
<p>Upstream project: <a href="https://github.com/Gitsaibot/AF-Weather-Widget">Gitsaibot/AF-Weather-Widget</a>.
Weather data by <a href="https://www.met.no/">MET Norway</a>, place search by
<a href="https://www.geonames.org/">GeoNames</a>.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
